// Public persistent loop-SE example. Uses only redistributable demo assets.

@chapter loop_se_demo "Persistent loop-SE demo"
@scene loop_se_start "Persistent loop-SE demo"

@loop_se ambience play se_select volume=0.15 fade=0.2
@loop_se detail play se_cancel volume=0.1

「Each stable channel loops independently while the scenario continues.」

@loop_se ambience play se_select volume=0.08 fade=0.2

「Changing only volume preserves this channel's player and position.」

@presentation_batch policy=join
  @loop_se ambience stop fade=0.2
  @loop_se detail stop fade=0.2
@end

「JOIN waits for both named channels to finish fading out.」
